Z||000003||Sage||01-26-2000||08:13 AM||||We wanna see <B>PICS</B>!  This was obviously written by one of the members of the govt. top secret engineers working on the real live future car,(was originally on the crew that built the vette grand sport) last word I heard was that they were having trouble lining up a Delorean and decided that the Fiero was the next best suited choice cause of the "space frame". <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||4
Z||000004||fiero56||01-26-2000||08:17 AM||||I remember back when this was posted on "the list". The guy didn't bother to mention he was joking. He sure worked up a buzz, the only e-mails coming from that list were about some guy killing a perfectly good Fiero.<BR>I got a good laugh this time too.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Just so you guys know, Benjamin Long did not write this story. Some hacker had gotten onto the system and used his name and e-mail. I remember the controversy it caused.<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 01-26-2000).]||||reg||1
